{{Quote|They're trespassers.''"<br />"''With respect, Chairman Cho, these creatures, the Talz, aren't advanced enough to master space travel. I think they may have been here longer than Pantora.''"<br />"''Whoever they are, they belong to us. This whole system belongs to us.|[[Chairman]] [[Chi Cho]] of Pantora and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]]|<ref name="Trespass" />}}
The '''Pantora system''',<ref name="Pantora">{{Databank|pantora|Pantora}}</ref> also known as the '''Pantoran system''',<ref name="Orto Plutonia">{{Databank|orto-plutonia|Orto Plutonia}}</ref> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Sujimis sector]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Appendix" /> It contained the [[planet]] [[Orto Plutonia]],<ref name="Orto Plutonia" /> the [[homeworld]] of the [[Talz]],<ref name="Trespass" /> and its [[moon]] [[Pantora]],<ref name="Pantora" /> the homeworld of the [[Pantoran]]s.<ref name="Trespass" />

